Hero5NativeAPP — licence status
===============================

NO LICENCE IS GRANTED.

The code written for this project is Copyright (c) 2026 the repository owner, all
rights reserved. No permission to use, copy, modify or distribute it is given to
anyone.

That is the DEFAULT position under copyright law, not a decision — it is written down
here only so the absence of a licence file cannot be mistaken for permission. The
owner may replace this file with a real licence at any time. Until they do, all rights
in that code are reserved.


What this file does NOT cover
-----------------------------
1. `vendor/` — two vendored forks of other people's crates, each governed by the
   licence file in its own directory: `vendor/arm32_cpu` (MIT,
   https://github.com/dlunch/arm32_cpu) and `vendor/softbuffer` (MIT OR Apache-2.0,
   https://github.com/rust-windowing/softbuffer). They are NOT relicensed by anything
   above.

2. 히어로즈 로어 5 (Heroes Lore 5) — the game. The original binary and asset
   archive under `payload/` are included only so the app builds. They are not
   covered by anything here and no claim is made to them.
   Copyright in the game belongs to its rights holders.

3. Reverse engineering notes (`ANALYSIS.md`, `docs/SERVER.md`, `tools_re/*`) describe
   that game's binary. They are observations about someone else's work.
